itionDescInactive1","conditionDescInactive2","conditionIcon1","conditionIcon2","conditionId1","conditionId2","conditionName1","conditionName2","conditionPostDesc1","conditionPostDesc2","desc","当有敌人的<#ba.fireinflict>灼热附着</>被<#ba.consume>消耗</>或<#ba.absorb>吸收</>后可以发动。\n来回穿梭，造成<@ba.fire>灼热伤害</>并恢复一定技力。","icon","icon_combo_skill_camille_01","锥心之棘","skillGroupId","skillGroupType","skillIdList",[4648,4649,4650],"chr_0033_camille_combo_skill","chr_0033_camille_combo_skill_2","chr_0033_camille_normal_skill_2","chr_0033_camille_NormalAttack",{"_4627":4060,"_4628":4060,"_4629":4060,"_4630":4060,"_4631":4060,"_4632":4060,"_4633":4060,"_4634":4060,"_4635":4060,"_4636":4060,"_4637":4060,"_4638":4060,"_4639":4653,"_4641":4654,"_19":4655,"_4644":4651,"_4645":37,"_4646":4656},"普通攻击：\n对敌人进行至多5段攻击，造成<@ba.fire>灼热伤害</>。作为主控干员时，<#ba.lastcombo>重击</>会造成<@ba.poise>{poise:0}</>点失衡。\n  \n下落攻击：\n处于空中时使用普通攻击，会下落并攻击附近敌人，造成<@ba.fire>灼热伤害</>。\n  \n处决攻击：\n附近有敌人处于失衡状态时使用普通攻击，将处决该敌人，造成大量<@ba.fire>灼热伤害</>并恢复一定技力。","icon_attack_lance","歃血涤罪",[4657,4658,4659,4660,4661,4662,4663],"chr_0033_camille_attack1","chr_0033_camille_attack2","chr_0033_camille_attack3","chr_0033_camille_attack4","chr_0033_camille_attack5","chr_0033_camille_power_attack","chr_0033_camille_plunging_attack_end","chr_0033_camille_NormalSkill",{"_4627":4060,"_4628":4060,"_4629":4060,"_4630":4060,"_4631":4060,"_4632":4060,"_4633":4060,"_4634":4060,"_4635":4060,"_4636":4060,"_4637":4060,"_4638":4060,"_4639":4666,"_4641":4667,"_19":4668,"_4644":4664,"_4645":39,"_4646":4669},"召唤<@ba.key>衔火血翼</>飞向敌人，对小范围敌人造成<@ba.fire>灼热伤害</>并施加<#ba.fireinflict>灼热附着</>。随后<@ba.key>衔火血翼</>将在目标周围<@ba.key>盘桓</>一段时间，期间对目标施加<#ba.weak>虚弱</>和<#ba.firevul>灼热脆弱</>。目标被击败时，<@ba.key>衔火血翼</>会飞向附近的另一个敌人，对目标造成<@ba.fire>灼热伤害</>，施加<#ba.fireinflict>灼热附着</>、<#ba.weak>虚弱</>和<#ba.firevul>灼热脆弱</>。\n<@ba.key>衔火血翼</><@ba.key>盘桓</>的敌人被卡缪的连携技命中时，将在短暂延迟后发生一次爆裂，受到额外的<@ba.fire>灼热伤害</>。","icon_skill_camille_01","驱火焚影",[4670],"chr_0033_camille_normal_skill","chr_0033_camille_UltimateSkill"